<title>UK: First Chicago NBD prices $250 mln FRN, 3ml +55 bp.</title>
<headline>First Chicago NBD prices $250 mln FRN, 3ml +55 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated callable floating-rate issue, announced earlier by lead manager Lehman Brothers International, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST CHICAGO NBD CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $250 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *01.FEB.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+55 BP    PAY DATE   L31.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  98.9596   FULL FEES   1.00</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    =	   L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>	     *CALL AT PAR AFTER 10 YEARS.</p>
<p>	     **DISCOUNT MARGIN 3ML +64 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
